VALUES ('b33c9509-8429-4e30-a193-9f7d230ef94f', 'NC26.5.SGMR.4', 2, 'numeric', 'Pack a box with unit cubes in layers', 'Mia covers the bottom of a box with one layer of 1-inch cubes. The layer has 5 rows with 8 cubes in each row. The box is 4 inches tall. How many 1-inch cubes does it take to fill the box?', '[]', '160', '5*8*4', 'One layer has $5 \times 8 = 40$ cubes. The box is 4 inches tall, so it holds 4 layers: $40 \times 4 = 160$ cubes.', 'checked', '{"lint":[],"solve":{"answer":"160","agreed":true,"single_answer":true,"aligned":true,"grade_appropriate":true,"error_free":true,"issues":"","work":"One layer: 5 x 8 = 40 cubes. 4 inches tall -> 4 layers: 40 x 4 = 160.","run_id":"claude-code","at":"2026-10-17T18:36:14.367Z"}}', 'ai', NULL, NULL)
